\ type: PSM
$40018000 CONSTANT PSM
$40018000 CONSTANT PSM.FRCE_ON                     \ Force block out of reset (i.e. power it on)
$40018004 CONSTANT PSM.FRCE_OFF                    \ Force into reset (i.e. power it off)
$40018008 CONSTANT PSM.WDSEL                       \ Set to 1 if the watchdog should reset this
$4001800C CONSTANT PSM.DONE                        \ Is the subsystem ready?
